            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "## AI Hub, AI Project and Azure ML workspaces\r\n\r\nCovers `microsoft.machinelearningservices/workspaces` of every kind - **Hub**,\r\n**Project**, plain **Azure ML workspace** and **feature store**. AI Projects are\r\nmatched back to their parent hub."
