              "json": "## Azure Advisor and Resource Health\r\n\r\nReads the `advisorresources` and `healthresources` tables for AI accounts and ML\r\nworkspaces. Empty panels mean no recommendations or health events exist for the\r\nselected resources - a valid healthy result, not an error."
